          "code": "EXTRACT_WORK_ORDER_DATA_FROM_USER_QUERY",
          "id": "1768455313068",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768455313070_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Extract data from the user query `{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}` and build a REST `pQparam` in valid Oracle REST Query Language (RQL) syntax for searching work orders.\n\n- **Always build a valid `pQparam`.**\n- If the user query does not specify any clear criteria (such as WorkOrderNumber, dates, asset, etc.) or if the input is blank/unclear:\n  - Use the default PlannedStartDate clause:  \n    `(PlannedStartDate BETWEEN '{{$context.$variables.StartDate}}' AND '{{$context.$variables.EndDate}}')`\n- If `ContextOrganizationId` having value  {{$context.$variables.ContextOrganizationId}} is available, always include the OrganizationId clause  \n    `AND OrganizationId = {{$context.$variables.ContextOrganizationId}}`\n- For any user query that does include criteria:\n  - Extract the relevant parameters and construct `pQparam` using valid Oracle RQL syntax.\n  - For BETWEEN clauses, always use parentheses (e.g., `(PlannedStartDate BETWEEN '2025-02-09' AND '2025-02-10')`).\n  - Output dates in YYYY-MM-DD format only.\n- CurrentDate value is {{$context.$system.$currentDate}}\n  - Always use precise date values from {{$context.$system.$currentDate}}, never literal placeholder CurrentDate.\n\neg.\n1) Get estimates for work order that starts with JKJ WO 001 in OrgId 123456789\npQparam = \"WorkOrderNumber like UPPER('JKJ WO 001%25') AND OrganizationId = 123456789\"\n2) Get estimates for work orders in last 1 week for context Org\npQparam = \"(PlannedStartDate BETWEEN 'CurrentDate -7' AND 'CurrentDate') AND OrganizationId = ContextOrganizationId\"\n3) Get estimates for work orders for asset Fork Lift.\npQparam = \"AssetNumber like UPPER('Fork Lift')\"\n4) Example for a complex pQparam\npQparam = \"UPPER(WorkOrderNumber) like UPPER('aBc%25') AND (AssetNumber = 'Asset_001' OR AssetNumber = 'Asset_003' ) AND WorkOrderDescription like 'ABC Wo%25' AND WorkOrderTypeCode != 'CORRECTIVE' AND WorkOrderSubTypeCode=UPPER('ora_planned') AND WorkOrderStatusCode IN ('ORA_RELEASED','ORA_UNRELEASED') AND (PlannedStartDate BETWEEN '2025-03-07' and '2026-06-24' ) AND WorkOrderOperation.OperationSequenceNumber = 10 AND WorkOrderOperation.WorkOrderOperationResource.ResourceCode IS NULL AND attachments.DocumentPreviewURL IS NOT NULL AND WorkOrderOperation.WorkOrderOperationMaterial.InventoryItemNumber = 'm-assy-srl-p'\"\n\n-Return only the constructed `pQparam` string. \n-Never return an error or explanation, always return a valid query string, defaulting to the PlannedStartDate clause if the user input is missing or unclear."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"pQparam\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
